# Measurement OUTPUTS are regenerated, never authored: tracking them dirties the
# tree on every run, which breaks the clean pre/post state a Boundary B record
# requires. The generator is tracked; what it emits is not.
dev/measurement/snapshots/
dev/measurement/suite-cost.md
